  "description": "AntJob distributed task scheduling SDK: high-throughput job slicing, reliable retries and elastic scaling across worker nodes. NativeAOT-ready, with built-in runtime localization; targets .NET Framework 4.5, .NET Standard 2.0/2.1 and .NET 8.0. 蚂蚁调度 SDK：分布式任务调度核心库，提供高吞吐量的任务切片、可靠重试与弹性伸缩能力；原生 AOT 就绪，内置运行时多语言消息；单包覆盖 .NET Framework 4.5 至 .NET 8.0 共 5 个目标框架。",
  "iconFile": "ant.png",
